    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25830" root="ضَعٌّ" body-key="D">
    
      R. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَعْضَعَهُ</span></b> , (inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَعْضَعَةٌ</span>, TK,) <i>He
threw it down,</i> or <i>pulled it down,</i> [or <i>rased it,</i>] <i>to
the ground;</i> (S, O, K;) namely, a building. (S,
O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَعْضَعَهُ الدَّهْرُ</span> <i>Time,</i> or <i>fortune,
lowered, humbled,</i> or <i>abased him;</i> (S, O;) and
so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ الدَّهْرُ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَضَعْضَعَ</span></b> . (TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَعْضَعَةٌ</span>
below.]

